<fw type="sig" place="bottom">Z 3</fw><fw type="catch" place="bottom">&#x201E;Jch</fw><lb/>
<pb n="358" facs="#f0364"/>
<milestone unit="section" rendition="#hr"/><lb/>
&#x201E;Jch finde, mein Herr, nach die&#x017F;em Ausdruck,<lb/>
