<fw type="sig" place="bottom">C c 3</fw><fw type="catch" place="bottom">Aber,</fw><lb/>
<pb n="406" facs="#f0412"/>
<milestone unit="section" rendition="#hr"/><lb/>
<p>Aber, mein Herr, &#x017F;ie wollten ja le&#x017F;en &#x2012; &#x2012;<lb/>
