<fw type="catch" place="bottom">gebohr-</fw><lb/>
<pb n="443" facs="#f0449"/>
<milestone unit="section" rendition="#hr"/><lb/>
gebohrner guter Grund&#x017F;a&#x0364;tze, verzeihen &#x017F;ie mir<lb/>
